1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:08,920
The reason why we call like self-awareness and the examining of self work is because it is laborious.

2
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:19,720
It's a heavy load and it is uncomfortable because it reveals oftentimes inconvenient truths.

3
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,760
It shows us our weaknesses.

4
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:29,240
It identifies for us our blind spots that we might be standing on as bold spots.

5
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:38,940
However, in the best case scenario, what it does is it connects you to the inner part of you, which is your soul.

6
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:47,240
And that relationship that you have with your soul should be stronger than any relationship you have with your state.

